# SafeGuard+ Environment Variables
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Firebase Configuration:
# Generated via FlutterFire CLI (`flutterfire configure`). 
# Firebase credentials are kept in `lib/firebase_options.dart`.
#
# Mapping & Location Services:
# The app currently uses OpenStreetMap (OSM) public tiles, which do not require an API key.
#
# Device Hardware Services:
# SMS and Emergency Calls use native device SIM / Telephony and URL launcher (no external API key needed).
#
# Optional / Future Third-Party Services:
# If you replace OSM with Google Maps or Mapbox, or add external SMS gateways:
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
# MAPBOX_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_mapbox_access_token_here
# SMS_GATEWAY_API_KEY=your_sms_gateway_api_key_here

